==English==

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|head=[[politically]] [[incorrect]]}}

# That which is not [[politically correct]]; that is considered to be disrespectful to a particular group of people.
#: ''The word "Frog" is a '''politically incorrect''' term for a French person.''

====Usage====
''Politically incorrect'' connotes language, ideology, and behavior that is unconstrained by a perceived orthodoxy or by concerns about offending or expressing bias regarding various groups of people.

